  "title": {
   "en": "Yosei Senzoku Kashi Shokunin"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "妖精専属菓子職人"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "One day, Sophia suddenly gains the ability to craft sweets that enchant fairies. As the sugar-hungry fairies clamor around her, she receives an invitation from a noble family—but her host turns out to be a ten-year-old boy!?\n\nAnd then, like a scene straight out of a fever dream, the angelic-looking young Count Lucas suddenly corners her with a smirk and declares,\n“You’re gonna marry me, right, lady? (dark chuckle)”\n\nTo avoid this absurd age-gap marriage proposal, Sophia is determined to conquer the young count’s appetite—and uncover the secrets behind his angelic mask!",
   "ja": "「僕の奥さんになってよ、おねーサン?(黒笑)」\n\nある日突然、妖精を魅了する菓子を作る\"力\"を得たソフィア。\n『あまいのだせや』と妖精たちが騒がしい中、伯爵家に招かれるが――相手は10歳のお子様!?\nしかもまるで天使なルーカス様が突然、高圧的な態度で「僕と結婚するよね、おねーサン?(黒笑)」と脅してきて……!?\n\n\"とんでも年の差婚\"を回避するために、少年伯爵の胃袋と素顔の秘密、掴みます!!!\nビーズログ文庫の大人気小説、『妖精専属菓子職人』が待望のコミカライズ！！"
  },
